	(text "FujiNet-Astrocade-Rev0 — all-in-one Bally Astrocade FujiNet cartridge.\nRP2040 serves the 8K cart window (pico/astrocade fujicade firmware); 3x 74LVC245\nlevel-shift the 5V bus. ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (fujiversal-astrocade) is USB host\nto the RP2040 (native USB, VID 0xCafe). Single USB-C via CP2102N flashes the S3;\nRP2040 flashes through the S3 (PICOBOOT doorbell / GPIO4-GPIO5 forcing).\nEdge: 1x26 0.100in single-sided per ballyalley (Tilton/MCM). SW1 = top-face RESET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
